000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    SVENINQS.
000400 AUTHOR.        BARBARA WINTER.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.  MARCH 8, l986.
000600*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000700
000800*REMARKS.
000900*D VENDOR INQUIRY SCREEN PROGRAM - REQUESTS VENDOR/CORPORATE CODE.
      *C   5/03/95.   WILL MCINTYRE    REQUEST 95-007
      *C     ADDED CALL TO TALTVENK TO ALLOW USER TO ENTER AN
      *C     ALTERNATE KEY, AND HAVE THE LINKED VENDOR CODE
      *C     SUBSTITUTED IN THE ALTERNATE KEY'S PLACE.
      *C
      *C   5/03/95
      *C     CHANGED REFERENCES FOR COPYCSIS/COPYMMIS TO COPYLIB.
      *C
      *C   17JUL1997   DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED TO PROVIDE FOR THE POSSIBILITY THAT FIELD
      *C     VEN-DISCOUNT-PERCENT MAY CONTAIN NON-NUMERIC DATA.
      *C     A DATA DECIMAL ERROR OCCURRED IN TYLER ON 16JUL1997 WHEN
      *C     THIS FIELD CONTAINED SPACES.
      *C
      *C   13JAN1999   J E COFFMAN
      *C     REVISED CODE TO HANDLE THE POSSIBILITY THAT THE
      *C     VEN-SURCHARGE FIELD MIGHT CONTAIN SPACES AS IT DID
      *C     AT THE PHILIPPINES.
      *C
      *C   20APR2000  DAVE PLUM
      *C     MADE FURTHER CHANGES TO HANDLE THE SITUATION WHERE
      *C     THE VEN-SURCHARGE FIELD CONTAINS SPACES AS IT DID IN
      *C     FAYETTEVILLE ON 18APR2000.
      *C
002200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002300 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002400 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
002500 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
002600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZVENINQ-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

            SELECT DVENDOR
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT DVENDITM
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0801
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT DVENDITM2
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0802
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT MSTORERM
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT DDESC
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1401
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
