028800**************************************************************************
028900**************************************************************************
029000*                            PROCEDURE DIVISION
029100*           CHECK IF CORPORATE OR VENDOR CODE WAS ENTERED.  VALIDATE
029200*           ENTRY FOR EXISTENCE.  IF CORPORATE CODE WAS ENTERED,
029300*           CHECK IF ANY VENDORS ARE TIED TO CODE AND IF SO, DISPLAY
029400*           VENDORS ONE AT A TIME.  IF VENDOR WAS ENTERED, CHECK IF
029500*           ANY CORPORATE CODES ARE TIED TO VENDOR AND IF SO, DISPLAY
029600*           CODES 10 AT A TIME.
029700**************************************************************************
029800**************************************************************************
029900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING   BASE,
030000                            PASS-SPOOL,
030100                            FORMFILE,
030200                            VIEW-COMAREA,
030300                            LANGUAGE-PARMS.
030400
030500 00-MAIN.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT DVENDOR, DVENDITM, MSTORERM, DDESC.
           OPEN INPUT DVENDITM2.
       02-LOOP.
           MOVE 0 TO END-FLAG.
030600     PERFORM 100-GET-VENDOR-OR-CORPCODE THRU 199-EXIT.
030700     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
030800        GO TO 09-EXIT.
030900
031000     IF VIEW-CORPCODE = SPACES
              PERFORM 830-CLEAR-SUBFILE1 THRU 839-EXIT
031100        PERFORM 300-BY-VENDOR THRU 399-EXIT
031200     ELSE
              PERFORM 820-CLEAR-SUBFILE2 THRU 829-EXIT
031300        PERFORM 200-BY-CORPCODE THRU 299-EXIT.
031400
031600     GO TO 02-LOOP.
031700
031800 09-EXIT.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, DVENDOR, DVENDITM, MSTORERM, DDESC.
           CLOSE DVENDITM2.
           GOBACK.
031900
032000**************************************************************************
032100*           VALIDATE VENDOR OR CORPORATE CODE AND GET DATA FOR           *
032200*           TOP SCREEN THAT FREEZES WHILE INDIVIDUAL ITEMS SCROLL        *
032300*           UNDERNEATH.                                                  *
032400**************************************************************************
032500 100-GET-VENDOR-OR-CORPCODE.
032600     MOVE VENBYSC TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES TO SCREEN-BUFFER.

034000 150-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO SCREEN-BUFFER.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
035800
035900     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 3
036000        GO TO 199-EXIT.
036100
036200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 1 OR
036300        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2 OR
036400        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8 OR
036500        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036600        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7 OR
036700        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6
036800        PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900        GO TO 150-SHOW-FORM.
037000
           MOVE "Y" TO FIRST-TIME-FLAG.
